      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh! Well, I gave Toxie—my Toxel here—a Lumiose\nGalette. But when I looked away for a moment,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthe galette disappeared...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǇ",
