      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 127
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I know my Pokémon—Toxie’s the type to take its\ntime savoring any treat. There’s no way that whole<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ngalette got gobbled down so quickly.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǇ",
